Package: com.iosvcam.opencam
Name: iOS-VCAM OpenCam
Version: 0.5.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Open-source, editable virtual camera tweak. Runs in mediaserverd so it covers every capture client (stock Camera, TikTok, all apps). Pulls an RTMP stream on-device, decodes H264 via VideoToolbox, and overwrites the camera's OWN image buffer IN PLACE at BWNodeOutput -emitSampleBuffer: with a SINGLE GPU-accelerated VTPixelTransferSessionTransferImage (one pass, no per-frame pixel rotation, no CVPixelBuffer lock around the transfer), then passes the ORIGINAL sample buffer downstream - matching the closed vcamera's GPU sync discipline (render nodes stay pass-through; orientation is carried by the pipeline's existing metadata). Every client reads the same overwritten upstream IOSurface, so the app preview shows OBS. Fail-open everywhere (any error falls back to the real camera). NOTE: the global microphone/audio hook (VCamAudioMS.x) is temporarily out of this build while the video path is verified; it returns in a later version. 0.5.3: fix phantom install / ellekit breakage on RootHide where /var/jb is a symlink to / (TweakInject == the dpkg install dir): the postinst/postrm mirror is now symlink-aware and only touches TweakInject when it is a genuinely separate directory, so upgrades no longer self-delete the dylib and removal no longer breaks ellekit. 0.5.4: FREEZE FIX - overwrite each sample buffer once, deduped by kCMSampleBufferAttachmentKey_TransitionID exactly like the closed vcamera (instruction-level RE); the camera graph re-emits each buffer ~10x/frame, and transferring every time overloaded the shared-surface GPU fence and wedged the preview after a few frames. 0.5.5: restore orientation (VTPixelRotationSession CCW90 auto-aligned to the client buffer) and destination colour (709/709/601) - both present in the closed vcamera and stripped during the freeze hunt; fixes the 90-degrees-rotated preview and the wrong photo colour. Now safe alongside dedup (runs once per buffer).
Maintainer: iOS-VCAM
Author: iOS-VCAM
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
Conflicts: com.x.vcamera, com.iosvcam.audiobridge, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.system-hook, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-active, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-probe, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.daemon, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.safe
Replaces: com.x.vcamera, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.media-active, com.iosvcam.audiobridge.safe
